# Secrets & Memory

- Put secrets only in `.env` (gitignored). Never commit keys or paste them into docs/PRs.
- Env names: see `.env.example`. Prefer `AGENTROUTER_API_KEY` + `AGENTROUTER_BASE_URL` (no OpenAI).
- On material product/code/docs changes, update:
  - `memory/CURRENT_STATE.md`
  - `memory/SESSION_LOG.md` (append dated entry)
  - `memory/FACT_CHECK.md` when a claim is verified or corrected
- Meter LLM via `src/lib/llm.ts`. Research via `src/lib/research.ts` (Tavily/TinyFish).
- Do not invent token addresses or contest rules — verify live first.
